      "message": "[warning] Line 375: If a foreground-service start succeeds but `CallNotificationService` never consumes the pending notification, `callNotifications[nid]` remains in the map because cleanup only happens on thrown exceptions or stale-call checks. This can happen if the service is killed before `showCallNotification()` runs or fails during startup. Track the start attempt and remove the pending entry when the gated Completable terminates without the service consuming it, for example by storing a consumed flag or removing the nid in a `doFinally` unless `showCallNotification()` has removed it.",
